title: "Vibration Detection Pi: Edge AI Predictive Maintenance"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An open-source prototype for local vibration monitoring on Raspberry Pi,
  combining signal feature extraction, supervised fault-pattern classification,
  anomaly detection and inference benchmarking.
